╭─ Overview ───────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Description                                              │
│   Summary                                                │
│                                                          │
│   This change adds a retry policy to the sync            │
│   client so transient network failures no longer         │
│   abort a whole run. It replaces the ad-hoc loop         │
│   in  sync.go  with a small, well-tested helper.         │
│                                                          │
│   What changed                                           │
│                                                          │
│   • Added  Retry  with exponential backoff and           │
│   jitter                                                 │
│   • Moved the timeout handling into the helper           │
│   • Deleted the legacy  retryForever  function           │
│                                                          │
